   "he": "כְּלָל אָמַר רַבִּי עֲקִיבָא וְכוּ׳. אָמַר רַב יְהוּדָה אָמַר רַב: הֲלָכָה כְּרַבִּי עֲקִיבָא.",
   "en": "We learned in the mishna: «A principle was stated by Rabbi Akiva:» Any prohibited labor that can be performed on Shabbat eve does not override Shabbat; however, any prohibited labor that cannot be performed on Shabbat eve overrides Shabbat. «Rav Yehuda said» that «Rav said:» The «halakha is in accordance with» the opinion of «Rabbi Akiva» in this matter."
  }
